# MotionSense @VERSION@

Firmware for the Luckfox Pico Pro Max (RV1106, SPI NAND boot), built on
@BUILD_DATE@ from the board configuration `@BOARD_CFG@`.

`images/update.img` is the whole flash. Put the board in loader mode and
write it with Rockchip's upgrade tool:

```
adb reboot loader
upgrade_tool uf images/update.img
```

The other files in `images/` are the individual partitions that make up
`update.img`, for anyone flashing them one at a time. Recordings, the
database and `config.yaml` live on the SD card and are not touched by a
flash.

What the device does, how to configure it and what it needs from the SD
card: https://github.com/zhu30844/MotionSense

`SOURCES.md` names the exact revisions this image was built from.
`THIRD-PARTY.md` and `licences/` carry the terms of everything in it.
`SHA256SUMS` covers every file in this bundle.
